  "design_notes": [
    "Section 7.2.2 is headed \"Capsule contracts (C3, C4, C6)\" and restricts no single option, so every capsule lists all three.",
    "Capacity \"2 crew or 3 t cargo\" is stored as crew_capacity 2 and cargo_capacity_t 3. The deep-space capsule gives \"4 crew, 21 days\" and no cargo figure, so cargo_capacity_t is left out.",
    "The table has no Cost or Twin column: \"cheap\" (compact) has no number, and no twin is stored.",
    "Table 5.1 gives capsule payloads of 6 t (C3), 8 t (C4) and 10 t (C6); this table has 6 t, 9 t and 10 t + 15 t service module. The design does not say how the two relate (open question 10 in data/README.md).",
    "\"Cramped (crew morale −)\" has no number: flag crew_morale_penalty. \"Lunar-rated life support\" is the flag lunar_rated_life_support; the design does not say whether C6 requires it.",
    "Stats are tagged game_value (table 5.1 labels the payload a game value)."
  ],
